---
layout: base.njk
title: Field notes
description: Build logs, project write-ups and practical engineering notes from The Tech Shed.
permalink: /blog/index.html
---
<header class="archive-header">
  <p class="eyebrow">The notebook</p>
  <h1>Project notes.</h1>
  <p>Build decisions, useful details and the lessons behind recent Tech Shed projects.</p>
</header>
<section class="archive-list" aria-label="Blog posts">
  {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
  <article>
    <div>
      {% if post.data.previewImage %}<a class="archive-preview-image" href="..{{ post.url }}index.html" aria-label="Read {{ post.data.title }}"><img src="..{{ post.data.previewImage }}" width="1280" height="720" alt="{{ post.data.previewImageAlt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a>{% endif %}
      <div class="card-kicker-row"><p class="project-type">{{ post.data.category }}</p>{% if post.data.projectStatus %}<span class="status-chip">{{ post.data.projectStatus }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
      <h2><a href="..{{ post.url }}index.html">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="archive-meta">
      <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
      <span>{{ post.data.readingTime or "4 min read" }}</span>
      <a href="..{{ post.url }}index.html" aria-label="Read {{ post.data.title }}">Read note <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
